# Paths Semgrep skips (scripts/security-check.sh, .github/workflows/security.yml).
# This file replaces Semgrep's built-in ignore list, so the usual build and
# vendor folders are listed here too. Triaged false positives are not listed
# here: they are `# nosemgrep: <rule-id>` comments at the line, each with a
# reason (see SECURITY.md "Automated security checks").
target/
fuzz/target/
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
node_modules/
dist/
atalanta-results/
ext/
.atalanta/
# Benchmark run logs and outputs: recorded data, not code.
bench/*/runs/
bench/*/out/
bench/*/results/
bench/pilot/atalanta-results/
bench/**/__pycache__/
# Generated Xcode project and the built tree-server jar.
*.xcodeproj/
crates/atalanta-android/assets/
*.min.js
# The init templates (atalanta-cli/src) that these golden files mirror are
# what `atalanta init --ci github` writes into a user's repository; they use
# readable version tags (`actions/checkout@v4`) and the documented
# `curl | sh` install of a pinned release. Reviewed 2026-11-11; see
# SECURITY.md "Automated security checks".
atalanta-cli/tests/golden/
# The gitleaks allowlist lists fake key values on purpose.
.gitleaks.toml
